  <h1>Traditional Temple Architecture of Andhra Pradesh: The Dravidian & Chalukyan Marvels</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 12pt; color: #475569; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 16px;">Exploring the intricate granite carvings, gopurams, and acoustic pillars of Lepakshi, Simhachalam, and Srisailam.</p>
  
  <table class="meta-table">
    <tr>
      <td><strong>Article ID:</strong> HP-2026-001</td>
      <td><strong>Category:</strong> Heritage</td>
